  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>擷取字串開頭的三個字元。</p><p>讀取字串 <code>a</code>，輸出它的前三個字元。若 <code>a</code> 的長度不足三個字元（包含空字串），則輸出整個 <code>a</code>。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>Python 的切片語法在字串長度不足時不會出錯，會自動回傳原本擁有的部分。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>一行，包含字串 <code>a</code>，字串可能為空。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>輸出 <code>a</code> 的前三個字元；若長度不足三個字元，輸出整個 <code>a</code>。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>0 ≤ a 的字元數 ≤ 100</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "Blockly",
  "sampleOutput": "Blo",
  "samples": [
    { "input": "Blockly", "output": "Blo" },
    { "input": "Go", "output": "Go" },
    { "input": "ABC", "output": "ABC" }
